-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +2 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Reverberating\" title=\"Reverberating\">Reverberating 2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Reverberating\" title=\"Reverberating\">Reverberating 2</a>:</b> This effect causes the edges of this weapon to pulse with sound, dealing 2d6 sonic damage on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter +4</a></b>: This effect gives a +4 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to the DC to resist the character's <a href=\"/page/Sunder\" title=\"Sunder\">Sunder</a> and <a href=\"/page/Improved_Sunder\" title=\"Improved Sunder\">Improved Sunder</a> attempts.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deadly\" title=\"Deadly\"> Deadly +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deadly\" title=\"Deadly\"> Deadly +3</a>:</b> +3 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to weapon damage.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Nicked_Greatsword.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Nicked_Greatsword.png/420px-Nicked_Greatsword.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"455\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Nicked_Greatsword.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>The largest of the swords, this weapon can only be used with two hands. The cross guard of this sword appears to have some engraving that was filed off.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></tabl